msgstr "Hadisoana nisafidianana fakantsary"

#: src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "The selected camera cannot be opened"
msgstr "Tsy azo sokafana ny fakantsary voafantina"

#: src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Miezaha mifidy iray hafa"

#: src/onboarding.py:639
msgid ""
"Please visit\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-em"
"itter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\nto en"
"able your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Tsidiho azafady\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir"
"-emitter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\nmb"
"a hahafahan'ny ir emitter anao"

#: src/onboarding.py:704
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Fametrahana jiro 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Fametrahana jiro 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:723
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Tsy afaka mitahiry endrika endrika"

#: src/onboarding.py:728 src/onboarding.py:775
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Scan modely faharoa"

#: src/onboarding.py:734
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Tsy afaka nandrakitra ny maodely faharoa"

#: src/onboarding.py:735
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must "
"still be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than"
" turning it off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from S"
"ettings."
msgstr ""
"Voatahiry ny maodely voalohany anao, ka efa mandeha ny fidirana amin'n"
"y tarehy. Tsy maintsy mbola mazava tsara ny efitrano mba hahitanao ny "
"tavanao — ovay ny jiro fa tsy hamono azy — dia andramo indray, na tsid"
"iho ary ampio modely avy eo amin'ny Settings."

#: src/onboarding.py:769
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Scan faharoa: jiro samihafa"

#: src/onboarding.py:771
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on o"
"r off, move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep y"
"our face clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Voavonjy ny modely voalohany. Ovay izao ny jiro — ohatra, mamono na ma"
"mono jiro, mialà amin'ny varavarankely, na ampiasao ny jiron'ny efitra"
"no hafa — tazony ho hita mazava tsara ny tarehinao, dia tsindrio indra"
"y ny Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:805
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Setup"

#: src/onboarding.py:818
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Satan'ny TPM:</b> Mijery"
" fitaovana sy fitaovana TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:838
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Sata TPM:</b> TPM fitaov"
"ana hita. Mametraka <i>tpm2-tools</i> ho azy..."

#: src/onboarding.py:850
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Sata TPM:</b> Hardware T"
"PM 2.0 mavitrika. Ho voaisy tombo-kase tsara ao anatin'ny TPM ny tenim"
"iafinao."

#: src/onboarding.py:852
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Satan'ny TPM:</b> Hita n"
"y fitaovana TPM, saingy tsy nahomby ny fametrahana <i>tpm2-tools</i> m"
"andeha ho azy. Alefaso ny <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Mi"
"verina amin'ny caching fahazoan-dàlana mifototra amin'ny rindrambaiko."

#: src/onboarding.py:854
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dia afaka manokatra ho azy ny {} amin'ny alàlan'ny fanama"
"rinana endrika (kitapom-bola hita: {}).\n\n<b>Sata TPM:</b> Tsy misy f"
"itaovana TPM hita. Mampiasa caching fahazoan-dàlana mifototra amin'ny "
"rindrambaiko (AES-256-GCM)."

